  "question": {
    "text": "Voltage rating of a parallel plate capacitor is <math><mn>500</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>.</mo></math> Its dielectric can withstand a maximum electric field of <math><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>.</mo></math> The plate area is <math><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> . What is the dielectric constant if the capacitance is <math><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math> ?<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>&#8201;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#1013;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8.86</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math>",
